                    <mx:Field name="description">
                      <mx:String>Establish contact between the introduced metal precursor and ligand in the specified solvent and container for pre-ligation. The subsequent Wait represents the contact period, not an additional pre-ligation period. No agitation, temperature, or successful complex formation is implied.</mx:String>
